        <mxCell id="_gvEVvTMZBxYr6MyiVKy-17" parent="_gvEVvTMZBxYr6MyiVKy-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#eef4fa;strokeColor=#35536d;" value="&lt;b&gt;Identity and evidence rules&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Customer Identity has an independent surrogate key; it is not a weak entity. Provider + SourceSystem + LocalCustomerCode must be unique.&lt;br&gt;Resolve a CustomerIdentity to one canonical Customer; only verified identities may support an eligibility decision.&lt;br&gt;CitesEvent carries EvidenceRole; DerivedFrom carries ContributionRole. These are relationship attributes.&lt;br&gt;For per-sale rewards, prevent duplicate awards for Provider + Program + logical RuleCode + anchor Sale, even across rule versions.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
